Keep module and package names meaningful.

❌ What we should not do
❌ Import everything unnecessarily (from module import *).

❌ Forget to install external packages before using (pip install).

❌ Use wrong names while importing → leads to errors.

❌ Mix unrelated functions in one module.

❌ Overcomplicate package structure without need

